    {
      "text": "A screenshot of the PuTTY Key Generator window, given as an example of a key generation tool (Figure A4.2). The Key panel shows a highlighted RSA public key for pasting into an OpenSSH authorized_keys file, a key fingerprint beginning 'ssh-rsa 2048', and the key comment 'rsa-key-20210701', with empty passphrase fields. Actions offer Generate, Load, Save public key and Save private key; the parameters select an RSA key of 2048 bits.",
